#3200
warder spire ash~
an ash-clad spire warder~
An ash-clad spire warder watches you from the wall.
~
    The Spire's garrison marches in black lacquer and grey cloth, and
the ash settles on both, so that a warder who stands still for an
hour looks like a heap of cinders with a spear in it.  This one has
not been still.  The visor never opens, and the warder never speaks
except to give an order of the Spire's law.
~
