hound cinder~
a cinder hound~
A cinder hound circles you at a distance.
~
    The Spire's hounds are cast in the foundry like anything else, and
the cast is not a good one:  they are lean, they are wrong about the
joints, and they burn at the mouth.  They hunt in the Ash Court and
the foundry galleries, and they do not bark.
~
