thrall forge chain~
a chain-wrought forge thrall~
A chain-wrought forge thrall pours white iron down the channel.
~
    The Spire does not feed its foundrymen;  it makes them.  A thrall
is iron rod and grey cloth and a great deal of obedience, and it
works the moulds in perfect time with the hammer above it.  The face
is a stamped plate with a number, and the number is low.
~
