a grey councillor~
A grey councillor of the Spire studies the tin map.
~
    The Council's members are chosen for their longevity rather than
their wisdom, and they get both.  The councillor is robed in grey,
barefoot on the cold stone, and it has not blinked in your presence.
It is working out, patiently, what you cost and what you will fetch.
~
