#3205
gardener vitarium~
the Gardener of the Vitarium~
The Gardener of the Vitarium trims a row of salvage-crops.
~
    The vitarium is the only green thing in the Spire, and the Gardener
is the only reason.  Its hands are green to the wrist, its apron is
black with ash and sap, and it has grown most of itself from cuttings
over a very long time.  It will discuss soil with anyone, at length,
and it does not like to be interrupted.
~
