a salt-and-fire elemental~
A salt-and-fire elemental burns low across the white crust.
~
    The garden of salt and fire is fed by the spellforge below, and what
leaks up out of the crust has learned to walk.  The elemental is a
low, crawling ring of white flame with a body of salt crystal turning
slowly inside it, and it leaves a line of black glass wherever it
goes.
~
