#3207
ilyra warlock spire~
Ilyra, the Warlock of the Spire~
Ilyra, the Warlock of the Spire, stands inside the circle of runes.
~
    The Spire's spells are made by one person, and she has held the
post for longer than the Council can prove.  Ilyra is tall, grey to
the eyes, and quite untroubled;  the ash falls around her circle and
never into it, and she regards that as the whole of the argument.
Her fingers are stained to the second knuckle with whatever is inlaid
in the floor, and she is very careful about who she lets stand downwind of her work.
~
