#3209
vhalor crown ashes~
Vhalor, the Crown of Ashes~
Vhalor, the Crown of Ashes, sits throned above the falling ash.
~
    Whatever Vhalor was when the Spire was raised, it is the Spire now:
the tower's will wearing a shape of black plate and grey fire, seated
on the basalt throne at the crown of the world's last fortress.  The
banner behind the throne hangs with the frost of the upper air, and
the ash falls upward about it and does not land.  It has been waiting
a long time for someone to climb this far, and it is not grateful.
~
